---
import { timeline } from '../data/site';
---

<section class="section section--deep" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="story">
      <div class="story__text">
        <h2>My journey in Solana</h2>
        <p class="lede">I didn't join Solana as a developer. I joined as someone who believes in decentralization, in open communities, and in the power of values.</p>
        <p>Before this I was a journalist and a communications specialist. I worked in media, telling real stories and connecting people. When the war in Ukraine began, I felt the need to build something meaningful — something resilient. That's how I discovered Solana.</p>
        <p>Instead of hype and speculation, I found a place where infrastructure and purpose could meet. I started a testnet validator in March 2022, just weeks after the full-scale invasion began. I had no prior blockchain experience, but I kept going — learning, building, contributing.</p>
        <p>The validator is still here, and so am I. Along the way it turned into more than a node: tools that explain validators and staking in plain language, an education hub in two languages, and a seat at the table with the people who build this network. This is how it happened, one date at a time.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="story__figure">
        <picture>
          <source srcset="/images/andrii-solana-summit-2026-600.webp 600w, /images/andrii-solana-summit-2026.webp 1200w" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 380px, 90vw" type="image/webp" />
          <img src="/images/andrii-solana-summit-2026.jpg" width="1200" height="1300" alt="Andrii standing in the main hall of Solana Summit Serbia in Belgrade, August 2026" loading="lazy" />
        </picture>
        <figcaption>Solana Summit Serbia, Belgrade — my first Solana conference in person. August 2026.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <ol class="timeline" aria-label="Timeline">
      {timeline.map((group) => (
        <li class="timeline__year">
          <h3 class="timeline__year-label">{group.year}</h3>
          <ol class="timeline__items">
            {group.items.map((m) => (
              <li class="milestone">
                <p class="milestone__date">{m.date}</p>
                <p class="milestone__title">{m.title}</p>
                {m.detail && <p class="milestone__detail">{m.detail}</p>}
                {m.link && (
                  <p class="milestone__link">
                    <a href={m.link.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{m.link.label}</a>
                  </p>
                )}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ol>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .story {
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    align-items: start;
    margin-bottom: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5rem);
  }

  .story__text {
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }

  .story__text h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .story__text .lede {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .story__text p:not(.lede) {
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }

  .story__figure {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 380px;
  }

  .story__figure img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    aspect-ratio: 12 / 13;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .story__figure figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--ink-3);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .story {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 380px;
    }
  }

  /* Timeline */
  .timeline {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    position: relative;
  }

  .timeline::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0.45rem;
    top: 0.5rem;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--gold), rgba(249, 203, 32, 0.25));
  }

  .timeline__year {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 2.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .timeline__year::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.55rem;
    width: 1rem;
    height: 1rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--navy-900);
    border: 3px solid var(--gold);
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .timeline__year-label {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 2rem;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .timeline__items {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.4rem;
  }

  .milestone {
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }

  .milestone p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .milestone__date {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--teal);
    margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
  }

  .milestone__title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .milestone__detail {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .milestone__link {
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    font-size: 0.97rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .timeline::before {
      left: 8.4rem;
    }
    .timeline__year {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 6.5rem minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 3rem;
      padding-left: 0;
    }
    .timeline__year::before {
      left: 7.95rem;
    }
    .timeline__year-label {
      text-align: right;
      margin-bottom: 0;
      padding-top: 0.1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
